{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/sources(ofHyperedgeAt:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift#L185","fileName":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"IncidenceMatrixModule"}],"title":"sources(ofHyperedgeAt:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sources"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ofHyperedgeAt"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14BitCollections0A3SetV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BitSet"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"IncidenceMatrixModule","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:21IncidenceMatrixModule08OrientedaB0V7sources13ofHyperedgeAt14BitCollections0I3SetVSi_tF"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sources"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ofHyperedgeAt"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"position"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14BitCollections0A3SetV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BitSet"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/sources(ofhyperedgeat:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The sources of the column at ","type":"text"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the source plane’s column. O(⌈n\/64⌉).","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule":{"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"IncidenceMatrixModule"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix":{"url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The oriented incidence matrix of a directed hypergraph: entry (v, p) is −1 when "},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of column "},{"code":"p","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", +1 when it is a target, and 0 otherwise. Gallo, Longo, Pallottino and Nguyen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1993) define a directed hypergraph’s matrix this way (aᵢⱼ = −1 for a tail node, 1 for a head"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"node); a directed graph’s edge is the column with one source and one target, the matrix of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spectral graph theory (B·Bᵀ = L, Godsil–Royle §8.3) and NetworkX’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"incidence_matrix(oriented=True)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It conforms to "},{"code":"DirectedHypergraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the "},{"code":"Hypergraphs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms (B- and F-connection, components, the clique expansion) run on it unchanged; it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not a "},{"code":"DirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IncidenceMatrixModule/documentation/IncidenceMatrixModule/OrientedIncidenceMatrix/sources(ofHyperedgeAt:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sources"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ofHyperedgeAt"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BitSet","preciseIdentifier":"s:14BitCollections0A3SetV"}],"type":"topic","title":"sources(ofHyperedgeAt:)","url":"\/documentation\/incidencematrixmodule\/orientedincidencematrix\/sources(ofhyperedgeat:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sources of the column at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":": the source plane’s column. O(⌈n\/64⌉)."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/documentation\/IncidenceMatrixModule\/OrientedIncidenceMatrix\/sources(ofHyperedgeAt:)"}}}